        "pattern": "fix one’s eyes/attention on sth",
        "meaning_cn": "凝视某物；把注意力集中于某事",
        "definition_en": "to direct one’s gaze or attention steadily at something",
        "usage_note": "eyes/attention作宾语，on接关注对象；eyes fix on也可描述目光停在某处，不等于修理眼睛。",
        "boundary": "eyes/attention作宾语，on接关注对象；eyes fix on也可描述目光停在某处，不等于修理眼睛。",
        "direction": "R+P",
        "level": "L2"
      }
